title: "Code for FABIO-AMMO: planetary health diet and ammonia emissions in Europe"
abstract: "Python code used to quantify the effects of adopting a planetary health diet on agricultural ammonia emissions in Europe, coupling the FABIO multi-regional input-output model with the AP-AMMO emission model."
